      "value": "I think it is rather easy to implement.\n\nCheck whether in Prefab Mode in `IsValidBuilder` of `VRCSdkControlPanelAvatarBuilder` by `PrefabStageUtility.GetCurrentPrefabStage()` and update the error message in `CreateBuilderErrorGUI`",
